# Keep host build artifacts out of the Docker build context. Critical for the
# React build stage: the host node_modules carries a macOS esbuild binary that
# would fail in the Linux build, so node_modules must be re-installed via
# `npm ci` inside the image. Also speeds up the Go stage's `COPY . .`.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
.github
*.log
.load-logs
.chaos-*
.k6-*
.e2e-auction-id
.load-auction-id
